e><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>John Snow, Thomas Wakley, and The Lancet</article-title><source>Anaesthesia</source><year>2002</year><volume>57</volume><fpage>667</fpage><lpage>675</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12059826</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="b10"><label>10</label><citation citation-type="journal"><article-title>Review and Notices of Books: Transactions of the Belfast Clinical and Pathological Society</article-title><source>Dublin Medical Press</source><year>1853</year><volume>33</volume><fpage>151</fpage><lpage>152</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b11"><label>11</label><citation citation-type="journal"><article-title>Belfast Medical Society: Thirty-third Anniversary Dinner</article-title><source>Dublin Medical Press</source><year>1856</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>11</fpage><lpage>13</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="b12"><label>12</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esler</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early History of Medicine in Belfast: Part 1</article-title><source>Dublin J Med Sci</source><year>1885</year><volume>79</volume><fpage>158</fpage><lpage>169</lpage><comment>Transcripts of these references are available on the UMS website. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ums.ac.uk"/> Accessed 30 September 2005</comment></citation></ref><ref id="b13"><label>13</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Esler</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Early History of Medicine in Belfast: Part 2</article-title><source>Dublin J Med Sci</source><year>1886</year><volume>82</volume><fpage>75</fpage><lpage>84</lpage><comment>Transcripts of these references are available on the UMS website. <ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.ums.ac.uk"/> Accessed 30 September 2005</comment></citation></ref><ref id="b