label><caption><p>The first text. Dr JM Sander's case of haematocele published in the <italic>Dublin Hospital Gazette</italic> on 1 June 1845.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="umj7501-072-f2"/></fig><fig id="fig3" position="float"><label>Fig 3</label><caption><p>Reproduction of part of the lithographed abstract of the post-mortem report on the case of <italic>Cardiac and Hepatic Disease</italic> read by Dr McGee at the meeting of the Belfast Clinical and Pathological Society on February 21 1857.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="umj7501-072-f3"/></fig><fig id="fig4" position="float"><label>Fig 4</label><caption><p>The last text. From Dr F Coates's paper on the pituitary in the <italic>Transactions of the Ulster Medical Society</italic> 1928/1929.</p></caption><graphic xlink:href="umj7501-072-f4"/></fig></sec></back></article>